WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.647
Android apps running

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:02.531
with no Android

00:00:02.343 --> 00:00:03.026
at all

00:00:03.558 --> 00:00:04.678
Winedroid is a

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.704
reimplementation of

00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:07.119
Android written entirely

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:07.744
in Rust

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:08.873
It runs real

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.383
APK files downloaded

00:00:10.194 --> 00:00:11.597
from F-Droid without

00:00:11.421 --> 00:00:12.588
Android underneath

00:00:13.126 --> 00:00:14.317
A browser demo

00:00:14.128 --> 00:00:15.083
loads a twelve

00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:16.215
megabyte WebAssembly

00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:17.477
runtime and runs

00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:17.972
apps like a

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:18.644
calculator

00:00:18.739 --> 00:00:19.906
a file explorer

00:00:20.084 --> 00:00:21.463
a meditation timer

00:00:21.322 --> 00:00:22.052
and a weather

00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:22.371
app.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:23.853
It's early

00:00:23.992 --> 00:00:25.053
Not every app

00:00:24.865 --> 00:00:25.595
works yet

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:26.232
and the web

00:00:26.044 --> 00:00:27.069
build is slower

00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:27.765
because the JIT

00:00:27.577 --> 00:00:28.284
doesn't run in

00:00:28.096 --> 00:00:29.109
the browser so

00:00:28.921 --> 00:00:30.124
native Winedroid is

00:00:29.935 --> 00:00:30.654
smoother

00:00:31.182 --> 00:00:32.196
Full story on

00:00:32.007 --> 00:00:32.903
the dashboard
